 "name_en": "Core Inventory Management (BMC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Core Inventory Management (BMC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item covers core inventory management processes, including the following processes: post goods receipt without reference, scrapping, block stock, unblock stock, one step stock transfer, two steps stock transfer, stock overview, slow or Non-Moving Materials, Dead Stock Analysis, Goods Movement Analysis, and material document overview.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform customer returns scrapping: Goods issue to CO-PA</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform general stock scrapping: Goods issue to cost center</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Block material – stock transfer unrestricted to blocked</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Unblock material – stock transfer blocked to unrestricted</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Unblock material – stock transfer blocked to quality inspection stock</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support process-related transfer postings</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support legally required transfer postings</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>核心库存管理 (BMC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖核心库存管理流程，包括以下流程：过账无参考的收货、报废、冻结库存、解冻库存、一步库存转储、两步库存转储、库存概览、低周转或停滞物料、呆滞库存分析、货物移动分析和物料凭证概览。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行客户退货报废：发货到 CO-PA</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行一般库存报废：发货到成本中心</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">冻结物料 – 非限制库存到冻结库存的库存调拨</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">解冻物料 – 冻结库存到非限制库存的库存转储</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">解冻物料 – 冻结库存到质量检验库存的库存转储</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1089e710dc845778ca7dca7ccb1d8f6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持流程相关的传输过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持法律要求的传输过账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
